      "id": "claim_69d6d9b342cf4612964fbf8528794837",
      "statement": "A reconciler scans for expired leases (lease_expires_at <= now). Recovery converges an expired lease directly to settled state: Running without checkpoint or BeforeModel checkpoint → Queued (after grace window); CancelRequested → Cancelled (no grace); BeforeSideEffect checkpoint or unknown kind → Failed (lease_expired); claim_count exhausted → Failed (crash_retry_exhausted).",
